    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Arcade Puzzler with a twist. Instead of matching falling tokens of the same color, clear tokens by matching them up into a complete rainbow line.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAGES MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through stages on a map and defeat alien creatures by making rainbow lines. Can you save the world?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how long you can last and go for a new high score. Unlock additional endless modes by beating bosses in stages mode.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VERSUS MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two player versus with one keyboard or two controllers. Who can last the longest? Make rainbow lines to trigger attacks on the opponent and speed up their token fall speed.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Arcade Puzzler with a twist. Instead of matching falling tokens of the same color, clear tokens by matching them up into a complete rainbow line.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAGES MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through stages on a map and defeat alien creatures by making rainbow lines. Can you save the world?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how long you can last and go for a new high score. Unlock additional endless modes by beating bosses in stages mode.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VERSUS MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two player versus with one keyboard or two controllers. Who can last the longest? Make rainbow lines to trigger attacks on the opponent and speed up their token fall speed.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "short_description": "Match up falling color tokens to make rainbow lines in this Arcade Puzzler! Play through stages on a map, go for a highscore in endless mode, or beat your friend in local versus!",
